{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"音樂四","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"享太廟樂章十三首貞觀中魏徵褚亮等作","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用永和黃鐘宮三成，大呂角二成，太簇徵二成，應鐘羽二成，總九變同用。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於穆烈祖，弘此丕基。永言配命，子孫保之。百神旣洽，萬國在茲。是用孝享，神其格思。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝行用太和詞同冬至圓丘","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌鬯用肅和夾鐘均之黃鐘羽","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"大哉至德，允茲明聖。格於上下，聿遵誠敬。喜樂斯登，鳴球以詠。神其降止，式隆景命。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎用雍和","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"崇茲享祀，誠敬兼至。樂以感靈，禮以昭事。粢盛咸潔，牲牷孔備。永言孝思，庶幾不匱。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇祖宣簡公酌獻用長發無射宮","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"濬哲惟唐，長發其祥。帝命斯祐，王業克昌。配天載德，就日重光。本枝百代，申錫無疆。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇祖懿王酌獻用長發同前詞，黃鐘宮。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"太祖景皇帝酌獻用大基太簇宮","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"猗歟祖業，皇矣帝先。翦商德厚，封唐慶延。在姬猶稷，方晉踰宣。基我鼎運，於萬斯年。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"世祖元皇帝酌獻用大成姑洗宮","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"周稱王季，晉美帝文。明明盛德，穆穆齊芬。藏用四履，屈道三分。鏗鏘鐘石，載紀鴻勳。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"高祖大武皇帝酌獻用大明蕤賔宮","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"五紀更運，三正遞昇。勛華旣沒，禹湯勃興。神武命代，靈睠是膺。望雲彰德，察緯告徵。上紐天維，下安地軸。徵師涿野，萬國咸服。偃伯靈臺，九官允穆。殊域委賮，懷生介福。大禮旣飾，大樂已和。黑章擾囿，赤字浮河。功宣載籍，德被詠歌。克昌厥後，百祿是荷。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_19","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝飲福用壽和","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_20","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"八音斯奏，三獻畢陳。寶祚惟永，暉光日新。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_21","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用舒和","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_22","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"聖敬通神光七廟，靈心薦祚和萬方。嚴禋克配鴻基遠，明德惟馨鳳曆昌。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_23","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞用凱安詞同冬至圓丘","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_24","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹俎用雍和","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_25","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於穆清廟，聿修嚴祀。四縣載陳，三獻斯止。籩豆徹薦，人祇介祉。神惟格思，錫祚不已。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_26","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用永和","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_27","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅肅清祀，蒸蒸孝思。薦享昭備，虔恭在茲。雍歌徹俎，祝嘏陳辭。用光武志，永固鴻基。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_28","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"又享太廟樂章五首永徽已後續撰，不詳撰者。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_29","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"太宗文皇帝酌獻用崇德夷則宮，永徽元年造。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_30","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"五運改卜，千齡啟聖。彤雲曉聚，黃星夜映。葉闡珠囊，基開玉鏡。後為圖開。下臨萬宇，上齊七政。霧開三象，塵清九服。海溓星暉，遠安邇肅。天地交泰，華夷輯睦。翔泳歸仁，中外禔福。績踰黜夏，勳高翦商。武陳七德，刑設三章。祥禽巢閣，仁獸遊梁。卜年惟永，景福無疆。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_31","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"高宗天皇大帝酌獻用鈞天黃鐘宮，光宅元年造。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_32","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"承天撫籙，纂聖登皇。遐清萬宇，仰恊三光。功成日用，道濟時康。璇圖載永，寶曆斯昌。日月揚暉，煙雲爛色。河岳修貢，神祇効職。舜風攸偃，堯曦先就。睿感通寰，孝思浹宙。奉揚先德，虔遵曩狩。展義天扃，飛英雲岫。化逸王表，神凝帝先。乘雲厭俗，馭日登玄。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_33","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"中宗孝和皇帝酌獻用太和太簇宮，景雲元年造。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_34","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"廣樂旣備，嘉薦旣新。述先惟德，孝饗惟親。七獻具舉，五齊畢陳。錫茲祚福，於萬斯春。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_35","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"睿宗大聖真皇帝酌獻用景雲黃鐘宮，開元四年造。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_36","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"惟睿作聖，惟聖登皇。精感耀魄，時膺會昌。舜慚大孝，堯推讓王。能事斯極，振古誰方。文明履運，車書同軌。巍巍赫赫，盡善盡美。衢室凝旒，大庭端扆。釋負之寄，事光復子。脫屣高天，登遐上玄。龍湖超忽，象野芊綿。遊衣複道，薦果初年。新廟奕奕，明德配天。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_37","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇祖宣皇帝酌獻用光大無射宮，舊樂章宣、光二宮同用長發，其詞亦同。開元十年，始定宣皇帝用光大，詞更別造。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_38","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"大業龍祉，徽音駿尊。潛居皇德，赫嗣天昆。展儀宗祖，重誠孝孫。春秋無極，享奏存存。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_39","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"又享太廟樂章三首太樂舊有此詞，不詳所起。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_40","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神黃鐘宮、太呂角、太簇徵、應鐘羽，並同此詞。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_41","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"七廟觀德，百靈攸仰。俗荷財成，物資含養。道光執契，化籠提象。肅肅雍雍，神其來享。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_42","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"金奏無射宮，次迎神。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_43","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅肅清廟，巍巍盛唐。配天立極，累聖重光。樂和管磬，禮備蒸嘗。永惟來格，降福無疆。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_44","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_45","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"五聲備奏，三獻終祠。車移鳳輦，旆轉紅旗。禮周籩豆，誠効虔祇。皇靈徙蹕，簪紳拜辭。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_46","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"則天皇后享清廟樂章十首","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_47","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第一","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_48","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"建清廟，贊玄功。擇吉日，展禋宗。樂已變，禮方崇。望神駕，降仙宮。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_49","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第二","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_50","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"隆周創業，寶命惟新。敬宗茂典，爰表虔禋。聲明已備，文物斯陳。肅容如在，懇志方申。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_51","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第三登歌","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_52","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅敷大禮，上謁尊靈。敬陳筐幣，載表丹誠。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_53","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第四迎神","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_54","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"敬奠蘋藻，式罄虔襟。潔誠斯展，佇降靈歆。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_55","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第五飲福","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_56","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"爰陳玉醴，式奠瓊漿。靈心有穆，介福無疆。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_57","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第六送文舞","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_58","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"帝圖草創，王業初開。功高佐命，業贊雲雷。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_59","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第七迎武舞","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_60","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"赫赫玄功被穹壤，皇皇至德洽生靈。開基撥亂祅氛廓，佐命宣威海內清。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_61","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第八武舞作","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_62","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"荷恩承顧託，執契恭臨撫。廟略靜邊荒，天兵耀神武。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_63","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第九徹俎","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_64","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌已闋，獻禮方周。欽承景福，肅奉鴻休。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_65","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"第十送神","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_66","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"大禮言畢，仙衛將歸。莫申丹懇，空瞻紫微。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_67","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"中宗孝和皇帝神龍元年享太廟樂章二十首不詳所撰","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_68","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用嚴和黃鐘宮三成，大呂角三成，太簇徵三成，應鐘羽二成，同用此詞。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_69","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅肅清廟，赫赫玄猷。功高萬古，化奄十洲。中興丕業，上荷天休。祗奉先構，禮被懷柔。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_70","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝行用昇和黃鐘宮","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_71","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"顧惟菲薄，纂曆應期。中外同軌，夷狄來思。樂用崇德，禮以陳詞。夕惕若厲，欽奉宏基。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_72","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌祼鬯用虔和大呂均之無射羽","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_73","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"禮標薦鬯，肅事祠庭。敬申如在，敢託非馨。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_74","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用同和太簇羽","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_75","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"惟聖配天敷盛禮，惟天為大闡洪名。恭禋展敬光先德，蘋藻申虔表志誠。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_76","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞用寧和林鐘徵","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_77","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"炎馭失天綱，土德承天命。英猷被寰宇，懿躅隆邦政。七德已綏邊，九夷咸底定。景化覃遐邇，深仁洽翔泳。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_78","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹俎用恭和大呂均之無射羽","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_79","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"禮周三獻，樂闋九成。肅承靈福，悚惕兼盈。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_80","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用通和黃鐘宮","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_81","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"祠容旣畢，仙座爰興。停停鳳舉，靄靄雲昇。長隆寶運，永錫休徵。福覃貽厥，恩被黎蒸。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_82","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇后助享皇后行用正和黃鐘宮，詞同貞觀中宮朝會正和。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_83","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌奠鬯用昭和大呂均之無射羽","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_84","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"道洽二儀交泰，時休四宇和平。環珮肅於庭實，鐘石揚乎頌聲。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_85","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇后酌獻飲福用誠敬黃鐘宮","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_86","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"顧惟菲質，忝位椒宮。虔奉蘋藻，肅事神宗。敢申誠潔，庶罄深衷。睟容有裕，靈享無窮。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_87","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹俎用肅和大呂均之無射羽","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_88","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"月禮已周，雲和將變。爰獻其醑，載遷其奠。明德逾隆，非馨是薦。澤霑動植，仁覃宇縣。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_89","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用昭感黃鐘羽","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_90","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"鏗鏘韶濩，肅穆神容。洪規赫赫，祠典雍雍。已周三獻，將乘六龍。虔誠有託，懇志無從。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_91","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"玄宗開元七年享太廟樂章十六首特進、行尚書左丞相燕國公張說作。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_92","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用永和三章","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_93","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅九室，諧八音。歌皇慕，動神心。禮宿設，樂妙尋。聲明備，祼奠臨。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_94","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"律迓氣，音入玄。依玉几，御黼筵。聆愾息，僾周旋。九韶徧，百福傳。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_95","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"信工祝，永頌聲。來祖考，聽和平。相百辟，貢九瀛。神休委，帝孝成。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_96","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝行用太和一章","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_97","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"時文聖后，清廟肅邕。致誠勤薦，在貌思恭。玉節肆夏，金鏘五鐘。繩繩雲步，穆穆天容。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_98","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌瓚用肅和一章","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_99","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"天子孝享，工歌溥將。躬祼鬱鬯，乃焚膋薌。臭以達旨，聲以求陽。奉時烝嘗，永代不忘。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_100","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎用雍和二章","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_101","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"在滌嘉豢，麗碑敬牲。角握之牡，色純之騂。火傳陽燧，水溉陰精。太公胖俎，傅說和羹。俎豆有馥，齋盛絜豐。亦有和羹，旣戒旣平。鼓鐘管磬，肅唱和鳴。皇皇后祖，賚我思成。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_102","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝酌醴齊用文舞一章","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_103","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"聖謩九德，真言五千。慶集昌冑，符開帝先。高文杖鉞，克配彼天。三宗握鏡，六合煥然。帝其承祀，率禮罔愆。圖書霧出，日月清懸。舞形德類，詠諗功傳。黃龍蜿蟺，綵雲蹁躚。五行氣順，八佾風宣。介此百祿，於皇萬年。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_104","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"獻祖宣皇帝室奠獻用光大之舞一章","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_105","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅肅藝祖，滔滔濬源。有雄玉劒，作鎮金門。玄王貽緒，后稷謀孫。肇禋九廟，四海來尊。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_106","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"懿祖光皇帝室奠獻用長發之舞一章","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_107","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"具禮崇德，備樂承風。魏推幢主，周贈司空。不行而至，無成有終。神興王業，天歸帝功。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_108","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"太祖景皇帝室奠獻用大政之舞一章","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_109","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於赫元命，權輿帝文。天齊八柱，地半三分。宗廟觀德，笙鏞樂勳。封唐之兆，成天下君。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_110","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"代祖元皇帝室奠獻用大成之舞一章","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_111","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"帝舞季歷，襲聖生昌。后歌有蟜，胎炎孕黃。天地合德，日月齊光。肅邕孝享，祚我萬方。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_112","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"高祖神堯皇帝室奠獻用大明之舞一章","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_113","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"赤精亂德，四海困窮。黃旗舉義，三靈會同。旱望春雨，雲披大風。溥天來祭，高祖之功。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_114","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"太宗文武聖皇帝室奠獻用崇德之舞一章","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_115","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇合一德，朝宗百神。削平天下，大拯生人。上帝配食，單于入臣。戎歌陳舞，曄曄震震。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_116","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"高宗天皇大帝室奠獻用鈞天之舞一章","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_117","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"高皇邁道，端拱無為。化懷獯鬻，兵戢句驪。禮尊封禪，樂盛來儀。合位媧后，同稱伏羲。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_118","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"中宗孝和皇帝室奠獻用太和之舞一章","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_119","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"退居江水，鬱起丹陵。禮物還舊，朝章中興。龍圖友及，駿命恭膺。鳴球秉瓚，大糦是承。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_120","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"睿宗大聖真皇帝室奠獻用景雲之舞一章","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_121","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"景雲霏爛，告我帝符。噫帝沖德，與天為徒。笙鏞遙遠，俎豆虛無。春秋孝獻，迴復此都。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_122","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"又享太廟樂章十四首","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_123","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"玄宗至道大聖大明孝皇帝室奠獻用廣運之舞一章司徒兼中書令、汾陽郡王郭子儀撰。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_124","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於赫皇祖，昭明有融。惟文之德，惟武之功。河海靜謐，車書混同。虔恭孝饗，穆穆玄風。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_125","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅宗文明武德大聖大宣孝皇帝室奠獻用惟新之舞一章吏部尚書、平章事、彭城郡公劉晏撰。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_126","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"漢祚惟永，神功中興。風驅氛祲，天覆黎蒸。三光再朗，庶績其凝。重熙累葉，景命是膺。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_127","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝飲福受脤用福和一章","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_128","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"備禮用樂，崇親致尊。誠通慈降，敬徹愛存。獻懷稱壽，啐感承恩。皇帝孝德，子孫千億。大包天域，長亙不極。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_129","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用舒和一章","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_130","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"六鐘翕恊六變成，八佾儻佯八風生。樂九韶兮人神感，美七德兮天地清。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_131","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"亞獻終獻行事武舞用凱安四章","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_132","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"瑟彼瑤爵，亞維上公。室如屏氣，門不容躬。禮殷其本，樂執其中。聖皇永慕，天地幽通。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_133","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"禮匝三獻，樂徧九成。降循軒陛，仰欷皇情。福與仁合，德因孝明。百年神畏，四海風行。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_134","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"總總干戚，填填鼓鐘。奮揚增氣，坐作為容。離若鷙鳥，合如戰龍。萬方觀德，肅肅邕邕。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_135","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"烈祖順三靈，文宗威四海。黃鉞誅群盜，朱旗掃多罪。戢兵天下安，約法人心改。大哉干","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_136","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"羽意，長見風雲在。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_137","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹豆登歌一章","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_138","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"止笙磬，徹豆籩。廓無響，窅入玄。主在室，神在天。情餘慕，禮罔愆。喜黍稷，屢豐年。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_139","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用永和一章","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_140","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"眇嘉樂，授靈爽。感若來，思如往。休氣散，迴風上。返寂寞，還惚恍。懷靈駕，結空想。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_141","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"代宗睿文孝武皇帝室奠獻用保大之舞一章尚父郭子儀撰","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_142","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於穆文考，聖神昭彰。簫勺群慝，含光遠方。萬物茂遂，九夷賔王。愔愔雲韶，德音不忘。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_143","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"德宗神武孝文皇帝室奠獻用文明之舞一章尚書左丞平章事鄭餘慶撰","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_144","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"開邸除暴，時邁勛尊。三元告命，四極駿奔。金枝翠葉，煇燭瑤琨。象德億載，貽慶湯孫。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_145","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"順宗至德大聖大安孝皇帝室奠獻用大順之舞一章中書侍郎、平章事鄭絪撰。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_146","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於穆時文，受天明命。允恭玄默，化成理定。出震嗣德，應乾傳聖。猗歟緝熙，千億流慶。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_147","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"憲宗聖神章武孝皇帝室奠獻用象德之舞一章中書侍郎、平章事段文昌撰。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_148","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅肅清廟，登顯至德。澤周八荒，兵定四極。生物咸遂，群盜滅息。明聖欽承，子孫千億。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_149","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"儀坤廟樂章十二首","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_150","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用永和林鐘宮，散騎常侍、昭文館學士徐彥伯作。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_151","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"猗若清廟，肅肅熒熒。國薦嚴祀，坤輿淑靈。有几在室，有樂在庭。臨茲孝享，百祿惟寧。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_152","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"金奏夷則宮，不詳作者。一本無此章。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_153","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"陰靈効祉，軒曜降精。祥符淑氣，慶集柔明。瑤俎旣列，雕桐發聲。徽猷永遠，比德皇英。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_154","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝行用太和黃鐘宮，左諭德、昭文館學士邱說撰。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_155","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"孝哉我后，沖乎迺聖。道映重華，德輝文命。慕深視篋，情殷撫鏡。萬國移風，兆人承慶。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_156","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"酌獻登歌用肅和中呂均之太簇羽，一云蕤賔均之夾鐘羽，太子洗馬、昭文館學士張齊賢撰。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_157","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"祼圭旣濯，鬱鬯旣陳。畫羃雲舉，黃流玉醇。儀充獻酌，禮盛衆禋。地察惟孝，愉焉饗親。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_158","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎用雍和姑洗羽，太中大夫、昭文館學士鄭善玉作。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_159","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"酌鬱旣灌，取蕭方爇。籩豆靜嘉，簠簋芬飶。魚腊薦美，牲牷表潔。是戢是將，載迎載列。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_160","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"肅明皇后室酌獻用昭升林鐘宮，禮部尚書、昭文館學士薛稷作。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_161","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"陽靈配德，陰魄昭升。堯壇鳳下，漢室龍興。俔天作對，前旒是凝。化行南國，道盛西陵。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_162","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"造舟集灌，無德而稱。我粢旣潔，我醴旣澄。陰陰靈廟，光靈若憑。德馨惟饗，孝思蒸蒸。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_163","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"昭成皇后室酌獻用坤貞不詳作者","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_164","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"乾道旣亨，坤元以貞。肅雍攸在，輔佐斯成。外睦九族，內光一庭。克生叡哲，祚我休明。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_165","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"欽若徽範，悠哉淑靈。建茲清宮，于彼上京。縮茅以獻，潔秬惟馨。實受其福，期乎億齡。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_166","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"飲福用壽和黃鐘宮，太子詹事、崇文館學士徐堅作。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_167","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於穆清廟，肅雍嚴祀。合福受釐，介以繁祉。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_168","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用舒和南呂商，銀青光祿大夫、崇文館學士胡雄作。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_169","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文迎武遞參差，一始一終光聖儀。四海生人歌有慶，千齡孝享肅無虧。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_170","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞用安和太簇徵，祕書少監、崇文館學士劉子玄作。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_171","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"妙算申帷幄，神謀出廟庭。兩階文物備，七德武功成。校獵長楊苑，屯軍細柳營。將軍獻凱入，歌舞溢重城。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_172","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹俎用雍和蕤賔均之夾鐘羽，銀青光祿大夫、崇文館學士員半千作。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_173","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"孝享云畢，維徹有章。雲感玄羽，風悽素商。瞻望神座，祗戀匪遑。禮終樂闋，肅雍鏘鏘。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_174","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用永和林鐘宮，金紫光祿大夫、崇文館學士祝欽明作。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_175","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"閟宮實實，清廟微微。降格無象，馨香有依。式昭纂慶，方融嗣徽。明禋是享，神保聿歸。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_176","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"又儀坤廟樂章二首太樂又有一本，與前本略同，二章不同如左，不詳撰者。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_177","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神一本有此章而無徐彥伯之詞","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_178","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"月靈降德，坤元授光。娥英比秀，任姒均芳。瑤臺薦祉，金屋延祥。迎神有樂，歆此嘉薌。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_179","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神一本有此章而無祝欽明之詞","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_180","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"玉帛儀大，金絲奏廣。靈應有孚，冥徵不爽。降彼休福，歆茲禋享。送樂有章，神麾其上。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_181","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"昭德皇后室酌獻用坤元樂章九首內出","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_182","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用永和","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_183","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"穆清廟，薦嚴禋。昭禮備，和樂新。望靈光，集元辰。祚無極，享萬春。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_184","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌鬯用肅和","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_185","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"誠心達，娛樂分。升蕭膋，鬱氛氳。茅旣縮，鬯旣薰。后來思，福如雲。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_186","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎用雍和","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_187","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"我將我享，盡明而誠。載芬黍稷，載滌犧牲。懿矣元良，萬邦以貞。心乎愛敬，若睹容聲。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_188","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"酌獻用坤元","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_189","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"於穆先后，儷聖稱崇。母臨萬宇，道被六宮。昌時恊慶，理內成功。殷薦明德，傳芳國風。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_190","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用舒和","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_191","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"金枝羽部輟清歌，瑤堂肅穆笙磬羅。諧音徧響合明意，萬類昭融靈應多。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_192","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞用凱安","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_193","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"辰位列四星，帝功參十亂。進賢勤內輔，扈蹕清多難。承天厚載均，並曜宵光燦。留徽藹前躅，萬古披圖煥。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_194","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹俎用雍和","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_195","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"公尸旣起，享禮載終。稱歌進徹，盡敬由衷。澤流惠下，大小咸同。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_196","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用永和","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_197","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"昭事終，幽享餘。移月御，返仙居。璇庭寂，靈幄虛。顧徘徊，感皇儲。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_198","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"孝敬皇帝廟樂章九首","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_199","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用永和詞同貞觀太廟永和","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_200","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇帝行用太和詞同貞觀太廟太和","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_201","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌鬯用肅和詞同貞觀太廟肅和","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_202","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎用雍和詞同貞觀太廟雍和","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_203","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"酌獻用承光詞同中宗享孝敬承光","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_204","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用舒和詞同太廟","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_205","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞用凱安詞同太廟","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_206","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"徹俎用雍和詞同迎俎","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_207","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用永和詞同太廟","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_208","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"享隱太子廟樂章六首貞觀中撰","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_209","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用誠和","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_210","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"道閟鶴關，運纏鳩里。門集大命，俾歆嘉祀。禮亞六瑚，誠殫二簋。有誠顒若，神斯戾止。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_211","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌奠玉帛用肅和","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_212","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"歲肇春宗，乾開震長。瑤山旣寂，戾園斯享。玉肅其事，物昭其象。絃誦成風，笙歌合響。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_213","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎用雍和","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_214","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"明典肅陳，神居邃啟。春伯聯事，秋官相禮。有來雍雍，登歌濟濟。緬惟主鬯，庶歆芳醴。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_215","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入用舒和","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_216","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"三縣已判歌鐘列，六佾將開羽鏚分。尚想燕飛來蔽日，終疑鶴影降凌雲。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_217","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞用凱安","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_218","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"天步昔將開，商郊初欲踐。撫戎金陣廓，貳極瑤圖闡。雞戟遂崇儀，龍樓期好善。弄兵隳震業，啟聖隆祠典。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_219","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神用誠和詞同迎神","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_220","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"又隱太子廟樂章二首太樂舊有此詞，不詳所出。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_221","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_222","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"蒼震有位，黃離蔽明。江充禍結，戾據災成。銜冤昔痛，贈典今榮。享靈有秩，奉樂以迎。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_223","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_224","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"皇情悼往，祀儀增設。鐘鼓鏗鍠，羽旄昭晣。掌禮云備，司筵告徹。樂以送神，靈其鑒闋。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_225","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"章懷太子廟樂章六首神龍初作","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_226","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神第一姑洗宮","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_227","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"副君昭象，道應黃離。銅樓備德，玉裕成規。仙氣靄靄，靈從師師。前驅戾止，控鶴來儀。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_228","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌鬯第二南呂均之蕤賔羽","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_229","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"忠孝本著，羽翼先成。寢門昭德，馳道為程。幣帛有典，容衛無聲。司存旣肅，廟享惟清。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_230","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎及酌獻第三大呂羽","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_231","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"通三錫胤，明兩承英。太山比赫，伊水聞笙。宗祧是寄，禮樂其亨。嘉辰薦俎，以發聲明。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_232","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入第四蕤賔商","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_233","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"羽籥崇文禮以畢，干鏚奮武事將行。用捨由來其有致，壯志宣威樂太平。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_234","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞作第五夷則角","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_235","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"綠林熾炎曆，黃虞格有苗。沙塵驚塞外，帷幄命嫖姚。七德干戈止，三邊雲霧消。寶祚長無極，歌舞盛今朝。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_236","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神第六詞同隱廟","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_237","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"懿德太子廟樂章六首神龍初作","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_238","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神第一姑洗宮","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_239","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"甲觀昭祥，畫堂昇位。禮絕群后，望尊儲貳。啟誦慚德，莊丕掩粹。伊浦鳳翔，緱峰鶴至。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_240","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌鬯第二南呂均之蕤賔羽","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_241","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"譽闡元儲，寄崇明兩。玉裕雖晦，銅樓可想。絃誦輟音，笙歌罷響。幣帛言設，禮容無爽。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_242","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎酌獻第三大呂羽","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_243","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"雍雍盛典，肅肅靈祠。賔天有聖，對日無期。飄颻羽服，掣曳雲旗。眷言主鬯，心乎愴茲。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_244","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入第四蕤賔商","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_245","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"八音恊奏陳金石，六佾分行整禮容。滄溟赴海還稱少，素月開輪即是重。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_246","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞作第五夷則角","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_247","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"隋季昔云終，唐年初啟聖。纂戎將禁暴，崇儒更敷政。威略靜三邊，仁恩覃萬姓。","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_248","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神第六詞同隱廟","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_249","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"節愍太子廟樂章六首景雲中作","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_250","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神第一姑洗宮","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_251","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"儲后望崇，元良寄切。寢門是仰，馳道不絕。仙袂雲會，靈旗電晣。煌煌而來，禮物攸設。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_252","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌酌鬯第二南呂均之蕤賔羽","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_253","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"灼灼重明，仰承元首。旣賢且哲，惟孝與友。惟孝雖遙，靈規不朽。祀因誠致，備潔玄酒。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_254","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎俎及酌獻第三大呂羽","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_255","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"嘉薦有典，至誠莫愆。畫梁雲亙，雕俎星聯。樂器周列，禮容備宣。依俙如在，若未賔天。","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_256","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送文舞出迎武舞入第四蕤賔商","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_257","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"邕邕闡化憑文德，赫赫宣威藉武功。旣執羽旄先拂吹，還持玉鏚更揮空。","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_258","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞作第五夷則角","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_259","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武德諒雄雄，由來掃寇戎。劒光揮作電，旗影列成虹。霧廓三邊靜，波澄四海同。睿圖今已盛，相共舞皇風。","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_260","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"送神第六詞同隱太子廟","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_261","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"則天大聖皇后崇先廟樂章一首御撰先德謙撝冠昔，嚴規節素超今。奉國忠誠每竭，承家至孝純深。追崇懼乖尊意，顯號恐玷徽音。旣迫王公屢請，方乃俯遂群心。有限無由展敬，奠醑每闕親斟。大禮虔申典冊，蘋藻敬薦翹襟。","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_262","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"襃德廟樂章五首神龍中為皇后韋氏祖考所立，詞並內出。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_263","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"迎神用昭德姑洗宮二成","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_264","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"道赫梧宮，悲盈蒿里。爰暢徽烈，載敷嘉祀。享洽四時，規陳二簋。靈應昭格，神其戾止。","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_265","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"登歌用進德南呂均之蕤賔羽","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_266","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"塗山懿戚，媯汭崇姻。祠筵肇啟，祭典方申。禮以備物，樂以感神。用隆敦敘，載穆彝倫。","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_267","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"俎入初獻用襃德大呂角","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_268","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"家著累仁，門昭積善。瑤篚旣列，金縣式展。","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_269","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"武舞作","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_270","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"昭昭竹殿開，奕奕蘭宮啟。懿範隆丹掖，殊榮闢朱邸。六佾薦徽容，三簋陳芳醴。萬古覃貽厥，分珪崇祖禰。","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_271","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"亞獻及送神用彰德","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_cuu_duong_35_272","chapterId":"ch_work_cuu_duong_35","textTraditional":"名隆五岳，秩映三台。嚴祠已備，睟影方迴。","sentenceOrder":272}],"overrides":{}}